{"id":"tra_fico","lemma":"tráfico","pos":"noun","rank":1573,"glosses":["traffic","smuggle"],"ipa":"/ˈtɾafiko/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"tráficos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-tr%C3%A1fico.wav","examples":[{"text":"No había mucho tráfico.","en":"There wasn't much traffic.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/524384"},{"text":"El accidente retrasó el tráfico.","en":"The accident held up traffic.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803896"},{"text":"¿Por qué no avanza el tráfico?","en":"Why isn't traffic moving?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/422347"},{"text":"Él tuvo un accidente de tráfico.","en":"He had a traffic accident.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/531555"},{"text":"¿Cómo ocurrió el accidente de tráfico?","en":"How did the traffic accident happen?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/568480"}]}